```

That is the “I have had this thought before” layer.

## The important guardrail

Do not let the dreaming process directly modify the live controller.

Use three statuses:

```txt
observed
generated_candidate
human_approved
```

Only `observed` and `human_approved` affect live weights.

Dreams can propose. They cannot self-promote.

This prevents recursive slop.

