```

You can do this with:

```txt
PyTorch Geometric HeteroData
HGT / GraphGPS-style encoder
small MLP heads
frozen text embeddings
```

HGT is built for heterogeneous graphs with node- and edge-type dependent attention, which fits your many node/edge types. ([arXiv][8]) GraphGPS gives the more modern recipe of local message passing + global attention + positional/structural encodings. ([arXiv][9])

